#: nx_lib/finance.py:367
msgid ""
"A dossier registered under two branches is counted in both, exactly as "
"the workbook counts it."
msgstr ""
"Un dossier registrato sotto due filiali viene contato in entrambe, "
"esattamente come nella cartella di lavoro."

#: nx_lib/finance.py:375
